.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# ---- M9 (Aug 12, 2026): docs/ is deliberately UNTRACKED ----
# ~44MB of binaries (sample APKs/IPAs, icons, mockup HTMLs) do not belong in
# git. The .md milestone docs also live there - read them via explicit paths
# (knowledge.md points at them) and search with `--no-ignore` (rg).
# Anchored to the repo root (/docs/) - the unanchored pattern matched ANY
# docs/ directory, silently ignoring the M10 docs site's content in
# site/docs/ (the Pages workflow built an empty site -> 404; Aug 15 fix).
/docs/
